rooms_desc ({"The room is dimly lit with a black light and Marvin Gay's sexualhealing is playing over the stereo system. There is a loveseatagainst the back wall and a childs swimming pool filled with $240dollars worth of pudding. There is also a red phone on the wall tocall the mother ship when groove life support systems fail. Levonand Barry are sitting on the loveseat awaiting your arrival.","This looks like a dark back allley where it seems that is constantlyraining. Tin Tin steps from behind a stack of crates and throws aknife at your head when the Crow steps seemingly out of no where tocatch the knife inches before your face. On the roof of one of thebuildings you see a crow looking at you and voice echos through yourhead saying \"It can't rain all the time.\"","You walk into a diner where you see a bunch of men dressed inblack suits and ties discussing the theories of Madona's like avirgin. You catch the conversation just in time to hear \"dick, dickdick, dick, dick, dick, dick.\"","This is the room where shades does most of his training. One wallis lined with weights and the other a asortment of weapons. Thereis a heavy bag in the center of the room and the back wall is coveredwith pictures of victems or potential victems. There are picture ofeveryone from Kazak to the Haunter. The one's shades has offed haveknives thrown through them.","This room is dedicated to Kurt Cobain. The wall are covered withgold and platinum albums and multiple pictures and posters of Kurtand the rest of Nivrana. The stereo system constantly has all ofNirvana's cd's playing along with a collection of bootlegs shadesmanaged to get his hands on. You will often find shades here when heis feeling alone in the world.","This is a giant checker patterned room with black and white squares.In the center is a giant table which is set for a tea party. At thehead chair on the far end of the table Tom Petty (the rock GOD thathe is) sits in the mad hatter outfit inviting you to join him. Many ofthe guests are already seated and are cutting up an ice cream and cakereplication of Alice into pieces for everyone. Over the stereo systemyou can hear \"Don't Come Around Here No More,\" playing.","This is the greatest nudie bar in the entire world. Al Bundy is yourhost and he is sitting at the bar with drinks for everyone. There aretons of beautiful women jiggling their hooters just for you. There isalso a supply of nachos and pizza fingers for everyone. The women put thepizza fingers in their clevage from where you are allowed eat tham.Everyone always has a good time and when you are here consider the wife dead. Above the door hangs a poem by Al Bundy called \"I Care.\"","You are inside a resturant where there are tables that are inside ofcars surronding a dance floor. You are just in time for Jack RabbitSlims world famous twist contest. The first two contestanta are Miaand Vic Vega. You look around for a table so you can order a $5milkshake.","This little dive of a house belongs to the man who is just so fuckingsuave Ben. Frank Booth is there swaying as Ben sings \"In Dreams,\" intoa work lamp. All of Frank's friends are there and he has a Pabts BlueRibbon just for you. When one of his friends asks if he should poor itFrank replys \"NO, I want you to fuck it!\"","This is where Shades sleeps and has other types of fun. On the farwall is a king sized bed that looks very comfortable. On the oppositewall is a giant entertainment center. It has a huge t.v. and stereo system on it. There is also a vcr and below that Shades cd and tapecollection, below that is his movie collection. Next to his bed is asmall fridge which he keeps stocked with all sorts of types of alcohalcause who knows when your gonna need a drink. There are mirrors on thecieling above the bed and the carpent is black and plush. All in allyou'd say it looks like the place to be for relaxation.",})
